": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GlCm1IhDqg8Q7kNvwHZe8KQ&_nc_oc=Adq62z8pYXiuqA9dhS8WFs5Hfdzoruk4MMym32mcwi0kGTRIjFi_O4ePgtKHqBa09Xg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN7qNDVChXzv7i6fIY4mJUUgGzFJPcmmFfkUdayZdK2lQ&oe=6AC51C9B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IkNrhVzBrDoQ7kNvwHxrAc6&_nc_oc=Adqo1quceQCF2TOGNbfbBIO-5TwVK204bPKLEQOdtYPKYxcIXzVzPduMR5vUi9SIG8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNz3aXl8u9rfh2A9FbCF73s2lLWTYP8AxmQ7-6G7Zrc6A&oe=6AC50CE1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xI0Hpy9UOhMQ7kNvwF5S1pb&_nc_oc=AdoyVWoY0NztK6RWAltb9C27eBDS7XH08QP5YfpBRo0rZxBJauZatdOEooWtyvgfs1Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPT_lwtceGLhCN2Qd86XmeZii1JtDrwF4Yv-IsR8FKoFQ&oe=6AC4F9AF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=reSUH78YLnAQ7kNvwE27SnK&_nc_oc=AdpbZ4HI2fWGckVYUggjFxa1XkhRmDN49jRxJHayJYeHv-jVGrJjyHI8HhJLDL50l6s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP9YSTxwxUmO5LvVSPCnWqOjfasw_cjmxC2iNrzbyO8UA&oe=6AC4F952"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pQWHXkv0hJAQ7kNvwEjamaa&_nc_oc=AdoK7Y2bXfvsLWYNmgYvAFjLFID2KTsgWUgANOz9DJZdAiWKlL18ZFLbIaVRGn9hAKc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNcVRmqkSkh-JMu0lECFdeczSg1Vpupr1W4ktq5WZQghg&oe=6AC502FD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a